		{"id":"7da5ffc6faa7f52d","x":1967,"y":320,"width":653,"height":1780,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n\nsubgraph S1[\"DDL Not Available\"]\n    A[\"Raw Metadata from MongoDB\"]\n\n    subgraph MIS1[\"Metadata Inference Service\"]\n        B[\"Source, Table, and Column Inference\"]\n        C[\"Relationship Derivation Engine\"]\n        D[\"Embedding Summary Generation\"]\n        E[\"Persist Enriched Metadata to MongoDB\"]\n    end\n\n    F[\"Human-in-the-Loop Validation Layer\\n(Design Pending)\"]\n\n    A --> B --> C --> D --> E\n    E -->|User Feedback Interaction| F\n    F -->|User Feedback Interaction| C\nend\n\n\nsubgraph S2[\"DDL Available\"]\n    G[\"DDL Input Sources\\n\\nNote: DDLs are locally stored;\\norchestration required for retrieval\"]\n    H[\"DDL Parsing and Normalization\"]\n    I[\"Metadata Schema Extraction\"]\n\n    subgraph MIS2[\"Metadata Inference Service\"]\n        J[\"Source, Table, and Column Inference\"]\n        K[\"Relationship Derivation Engine\"]\n        L[\"Embedding Summary Generation\"]\n        M[\"Persist Enriched Metadata to MongoDB\"]\n    end\n\n    N[\"Human-in-the-Loop Validation Layer\\n(Design Pending)\"]\n\n    G --> H --> I --> J --> K --> L --> M\n    M -->|User Feedback Interaction| N\n    N -->|User Feedback Interaction| K\nend\n\n```"}
